hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
1598.1,"[1598] Malik told me, on the authority of Hisham ibn Urwa, on the authority of his father: The Messenger of God, peace and blessings be upon him, said: No one should leave the Medina without desire, unless God replaces it with something better than it.\\nA home in front of Malik Hadith: 1598 Arabic Hadith:"
1598.2,"[1598] Malik told me, on the authority of Hisham ibn Urwa, on the authority of his father: The Messenger of God, peace and blessings be upon him, said: No one should leave the Medina without desire, unless God replaces it with something better than it.\\nA home in front of Malik Hadith: 1598 Arabic Hadith:"
1599.1,Yahya related to me from Malik from Suhayl ibn Abi Salih from his father that Abu Hurayra said
1599.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Suhayl ibn Abi Salih from his father that Abu Hurayra said
1600.1,Yahya related to me from Malik from Qatan ibn Wahb ibn Umayr ibn al-Ajda that Yuhannas
1600.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Qatan ibn Wahb ibn Umayr ibn al-Ajda that Yuhannas
1601.1,Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir from Jabir ibn Abdullah that a Bedouin took an oath of allegiance in Islam with the Messenger of Allah
1601.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Muhammad ibn al-Munkadir from Jabir ibn Abdullah that a Bedouin took an oath of allegiance in Islam with the Messenger of Allah
1602.1,"Yahya narrated to me, from Malik, from Amr, the freed slave of al-Muttalib, from Anas ibn Malik."
1602.2,"Yahya narrated to me, from Malik, from Amr, the freed slave of al-Muttalib, from Anas ibn Malik: The Messenger of Allah ﷺ looked towards Uhud and said: This is a mountain that loves us and we love it. O Allah, Ibrahim forbade Makkah, and I forbid what is between its two lava fields."
1603.1,Malik related to me from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that the Messenger of Allah
1603.2,Malik related to me from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father that the Messenger of Allah
1604.1,Malik related to me from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father from Abdullah ibn az-Zubayr that Sufyan ibn Abi Zuhayr said
1604.2,Malik related to me from Hisham ibn Urwa from his father from Abdullah ibn az-Zubayr that Sufyan ibn Abi Zuhayr said
1605.1,Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Himas from his paternal uncle from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah
1605.2,Yahya related to me from Malik from Ibn Himas from his paternal uncle from Abu Hurayra that the Messenger of Allah
1606.1,Malik related to me that he had heard that when Umar ibn Abd al- Aziz left Madina
1606.2,Malik related to me that he had heard that when Umar ibn Abd al- Aziz left Madina
1607.1,Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Sa'id that 'A'ishah said: And 'Amir ibn Fuhayrah used to say:
1607.2,Malik related to me from Yahya ibn Sa'id that 'A'ishah said: And 'Amir ibn Fuhayrah used to say: \I have seen death before tasting it. Indeed," the coward's doom comes from above him.\"""""
