1608.2,Malik related to me from Ibn Shihab from Said ibn al-Musayyab that Abu Hurayra said
1609.1,Malik related to me from Yunus ibn Yusuf from Ata ibn Yasar that Abu Ayyub al-Ansari found some boys who had driven a fox into a corner
1609.2,Malik related to me from Yunus ibn Yusuf from Ata ibn Yasar that Abu Ayyub al-Ansari found some boys who had driven a fox into a corner
